# stage0 of the fixpoint chain: the release `pnpm term:boot` fetches, verifies and builds stage1 and stage2 with. The
# site's image index digest is the trust anchor. Until 2.10.0 is published it carries none, and stage0 is
# task/stage0.json's bundle; publishing 2.10.0 (item 0997) writes its index digest here as `@sha256:<64 hex>`
boot
  code <2.10.0>
  site <oci://ghcr.io/cluesurf/term/code>
